20
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:07,358
Part Two has been deployed on the server GPU
using AnomalyDINO. DINOv2 remains frozen; we

21
00:02:07,438 --> 00:02:14,796
extract local patch features rather than training
the backbone. Normal reference features form a
memory

22
00:02:14,876 --> 00:02:22,234
bank, and exact nearest-neighbor distances
produce anomaly scores and maps for test images.
This card

23
00:02:22,314 --> 00:02:29,672
