experiment, for the same image, reference, shot

24
00:02:29,752 --> 00:02:37,110
count, and seed as Part One. Its score is about
zero point two three two,

25
00:02:37,190 --> 00:02:44,548
above its own threshold of about zero point two
one nine, so the output is

26
00:02:44,628 --> 00:02:51,986
NG. This image is correctly detected. However,
the methods have different score ranges and
heatmap

27
00:02:52,066 --> 00:02:59,424
