29
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:06,170
The first comparison uses exactly the same one
hundred and fifty cashew test images. Image

30
00:03:06,250 --> 00:03:12,420
AUROC is sixty-five point three four percent for
Part One and ninety-two point nine zero

31
00:03:12,500 --> 00:03:18,670
percent for Part Two. Pixel AUROC also improves
