Error bars show standard deviation across seeds.

36
00:03:41,981 --> 00:03:44,920
The full Part One comparison remains future work.

37
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:51,499
The method still misses defects. This different
cashew image contains several tiny annotated
defects, but

38
00:03:51,579 --> 00:03:58,078
