41
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:16,001
Our next steps are to complete the full Part One
baseline study and test multi-scale

42
00:04:16,081 --> 00:04:22,082
feature fusion for small defects. We will compare
the proposed change with unchanged Part Two

43
00:04:22,162 --> 00:04:28,163
